<title>USA: Brooks sees Q1 results lower than expected.</title>
<headline>Brooks sees Q1 results lower than expected.</headline>
<dateline>CHELMSFORD, Mass 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooks Automation Inc said Thursday it expected its fiscal 1997 first-quarter results to be below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;(It will be primarily due to) a broad decline in the semiconductor manufacturing equipment industry that has resulted in slower than anticiapted customer process tool shipments,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Brooks said it foresaw sales for the period to range between $15 million and $17 million.</p>
</text>
